<p>Call upon the grace of the Eternals to increase your global speed by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Dexterity 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>Magic 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">10%, 20%, 31%, 40%, 47%</acronym> for 5 turns.</p><p>The speed bonus will increase with your Dexterity or Magic (whichever is higher).</p>